WEBVTT

00:00:00.960 --> 00:00:04.464
We've received word that Claw,
the esper terrorist organization,

00:00:04.714 --> 00:00:07.133
has barricaded itself
in the Seasoning Cultural Tower.

00:00:07.383 --> 00:00:10.011
It's possible that they might also
be holding Prime Minister Yabe,

00:00:10.261 --> 00:00:12.931
who was abducted from
Pork Bone City, prisoner insid--

00:00:13.181 --> 00:00:15.558
The kidnapper was a teleporter.

00:00:15.808 --> 00:00:18.353
He had the ability to instantly travel
wherever he wanted.

00:00:18.603 --> 00:00:22.732
And, according to the news, he can
also predict people's movements.

00:00:22.982 --> 00:00:24.317
Well, that's not really fair.

00:00:24.567 --> 00:00:28.238
How can one person have
two overpowered abilities like that?

00:00:28.488 --> 00:00:31.658
Did you end up with a high fever
because of your opponent's ability?

00:00:31.908 --> 00:00:34.661
No, this is just from the shock of losing.

00:00:34.911 --> 00:00:37.247
I also got a fever when I lost to Kageyama-kun

00:00:37.497 --> 00:00:39.165
and had nightmares for three days and nights.

00:00:39.415 --> 00:00:41.209
This guy sounds like bad news.

00:00:41.459 --> 00:00:43.545
Do you think they have more like him?

00:00:43.795 --> 00:00:47.674
I was always confident
I could take anyone on.

00:00:47.924 --> 00:00:51.135
But now... I don't know what to think.

00:00:55.682 --> 00:00:58.226
(Get ready, wake your psyche up, MOB!)

00:00:58.476 --> 00:01:01.062
(Get ready, dig your anger up, MOB!)

00:01:01.312 --> 00:01:03.940
(Get ready, wake your psyche up, MOB!)

00:01:04.190 --> 00:01:05.441
(Get ready!)

00:01:06.234 --> 00:01:10.697
Coming down,
could you fill your satisfaction?

00:01:11.906 --> 00:01:16.202
You're a MOB.
Can't you feel your own frustration?

00:01:17.579 --> 00:01:21.958
Coming down,
could you fill your satisfaction?

00:01:23.293 --> 00:01:26.087
You're a MOB.
What do you want to be?

00:01:26.337 --> 00:01:33.052
Wear your overflowing emotions
on your sleeve and break it down

00:01:34.887 --> 00:01:38.182
What do you see once you go
beyond your limits?

00:01:38.433 --> 00:01:41.102
(99.9! 99.9)

00:01:41.352 --> 00:01:44.272
The mysterious percentage

00:01:45.982 --> 00:01:48.443
Cr yin' my life, or yin' my psyche,

00:01:48.693 --> 00:01:51.446
Cr yin' my heart in such commonplaces!

00:01:51.696 --> 00:01:54.282
Is that your ideal? Is that your mind?

00:01:54.532 --> 00:01:57.118
It all begins when it hits 100

00:01:57.368 --> 00:01:59.954
The MOB is alive. The MOB is high.

00:02:00.204 --> 00:02:02.832
The MOB is staying frustrated, aren't you?

00:02:03.082 --> 00:02:07.170
Is that your ideal?
Is that your mind? Right now

00:02:08.630 --> 00:02:09.756
YOUR LIFE IS YOUR OWN.

00:02:10.006 --> 00:02:12.342
(Get ready, wake your psyche up, MOB!)

00:02:12.342 --> 00:02:12.467
"Mob Psycho 100 II"
(Get ready, wake your psyche up, MOB!)

00:02:12.467 --> 00:02:12.717
"Mob Psycho 100 II"

00:02:12.717 --> 00:02:15.303
"Mob Psycho 100 II"
(Get ready, dig your anger up, MOB!)

00:02:15.303 --> 00:02:15.553
"Mob Psycho 100 II"

00:02:15.553 --> 00:02:16.888
"Mob Psycho 100 II"
(Get ready, wake your psyche up, MOB!)

00:02:16.888 --> 00:02:18.222
(Get ready, wake your psyche up, MOB!)

00:02:18.473 --> 00:02:19.724
(Get ready!)

00:02:22.018 --> 00:02:26.981
"Collision
- Power Type~"

00:02:27.273 --> 00:02:29.776
Why did we move away from the capital?

00:02:30.026 --> 00:02:34.072
We could've just taken over
the tallest building in Japan.

00:02:34.322 --> 00:02:35.740
There are two reasons.

00:02:35.990 --> 00:02:39.452
The first reason is the omurice
in the cafeteria here is to die for.

00:02:39.702 --> 00:02:41.954
They use four eggs per serving.

00:02:42.205 --> 00:02:45.750
The other reason is I'm from this city.

00:02:46.000 --> 00:02:49.170
I know this city so well,
I can keenly monitor its changes.

00:02:49.420 --> 00:02:51.422
So this place is memorable to you?

00:02:51.673 --> 00:02:55.009
Maybe your old friends still live here.

00:02:55.259 --> 00:02:59.180
Old friends and memories, huh?
I can't think of any.

00:02:59.430 --> 00:03:01.391
I actually don't mind if you destroy it all.

00:03:01.641 --> 00:03:05.311
Really? Even though you
remember the omurice?

00:03:05.561 --> 00:03:06.896
Correct.

00:03:07.939 --> 00:03:11.067
The special anti-terrorism squad has arrived.

00:03:11.317 --> 00:03:13.403
We will now raid the Cultural Tower.

00:03:13.653 --> 00:03:15.071
Should I go?

00:03:15.321 --> 00:03:16.906
There's no need.

00:03:17.156 --> 00:03:21.202
Every soldier from Claw HQ is plenty capable.

00:03:21.452 --> 00:03:23.121
They aren't much inferior to
the upper echelon, the Scars.

00:03:23.121 --> 00:03:25.832
"LP Gas" They aren't much inferior
to the upper echelon, the Scars.

00:03:25.832 --> 00:03:25.873
"LP Gas"

00:03:29.377 --> 00:03:33.131
Most of those guys are
artificial espers, aren't they?

00:03:33.381 --> 00:03:35.967
When'd they become so strong?

00:03:36.217 --> 00:03:38.469
These guys aren't human...

00:03:46.018 --> 00:03:48.771
Hey, boss. Just out of curiosity...

00:03:49.021 --> 00:03:51.774
Did you do something to them?

00:03:55.361 --> 00:03:57.697
A news helicopter, huh?

00:03:57.947 --> 00:04:01.117
You're a pain. Go away.

00:04:01.993 --> 00:04:03.202
The controls aren't working!

00:04:03.453 --> 00:04:04.370
A malfunction?!

00:04:04.620 --> 00:04:07.373
I'm not sure! It's gone out of control!

00:04:07.623 --> 00:04:09.584
That's one big RC helicopter!

00:04:09.834 --> 00:04:13.921
Leave the fighter jets
and missiles to Hatori.

00:04:14.172 --> 00:04:17.967
I'll have Minegishi and Shibata go out
into the town to expand our territory.

00:04:18.217 --> 00:04:21.053
Serizawa and Shimazaki
will defend this base.

00:04:21.304 --> 00:04:24.432
We're going to show them
just how powerful we are.

00:04:24.682 --> 00:04:25.850
Go!

00:04:27.685 --> 00:04:28.519
No...

00:04:28.770 --> 00:04:30.688
What is this?

00:04:30.938 --> 00:04:33.357
We can't do anything about this...

00:04:33.608 --> 00:04:35.401
What are we going to do, Reigen?

00:04:36.694 --> 00:04:39.405
Hey! This is no time to be
eating cup noodles!

00:04:39.655 --> 00:04:41.824
Don't act like this ain't
none of your business!

00:04:42.074 --> 00:04:44.327
What are you talking about?
Of course it's not.

00:04:44.577 --> 00:04:45.203
Huh?

00:04:45.453 --> 00:04:48.664
We're not superheroes, and this is dangerous.

00:04:48.915 --> 00:04:51.834
It's best that we leave this
to the police and JSDF.

00:04:52.084 --> 00:04:54.003
What? Are you chickening out?

00:04:54.253 --> 00:04:57.757
What do you think we can even do
against people like that?

00:04:58.007 --> 00:04:59.091
Well...

00:04:59.342 --> 00:05:02.595
We all gathered here to
ask you that, you dumb-ass.

00:05:02.845 --> 00:05:05.890
Then here's my answer...

00:05:06.140 --> 00:05:07.600
Meeting's over.

00:05:07.850 --> 00:05:09.977
I thought we might have a chance with Mob,

00:05:10.228 --> 00:05:11.395
but this is just too dangerous.

00:05:11.646 --> 00:05:14.732
We'll have to lie low until things blow over.

00:05:14.982 --> 00:05:16.734
Reigen-san...

00:05:16.984 --> 00:05:19.028
I think that's the right decision.

00:05:19.278 --> 00:05:23.491
I'm going. I'd rather make the first move
than be on the run forever.

00:05:23.741 --> 00:05:24.909
I'm going, too!

00:05:25.159 --> 00:05:25.993
Same!

00:05:26.244 --> 00:05:30.581
This battle is our chance to
find a purpose for ourselves.

00:05:30.832 --> 00:05:31.916
Do whatever you want.

00:05:33.835 --> 00:05:37.213
Hello? Oh, you're calling
about the fire insurance...

00:05:37.463 --> 00:05:39.549
Yes, that's right...

00:05:39.799 --> 00:05:44.554
Huh? If you can't figure out the cause,
there won't be any payout?

00:05:44.804 --> 00:05:46.222
You couldn't find any kerosene or gas?

00:05:46.472 --> 00:05:50.059
Of course not! It was caused by
psychic powers! Psychic powers!

00:05:50.309 --> 00:05:52.353
You've never dealt with anything like this?
That's not my problem!

00:05:52.603 --> 00:05:54.355
Hey, wait a sec...

00:05:54.605 --> 00:05:56.732
My office burned to the ground!
I'm penniless!

00:05:56.983 --> 00:05:59.277
Why the hell do I even have insurance, then?

00:05:59.527 --> 00:06:00.695
What the hell are you talking about?

00:06:00.945 --> 00:06:04.991
Hang on. Look at his face.
I've never seen him so serious before.

00:06:06.909 --> 00:06:11.247
You guys are determined to fight, aren't you?

00:06:11.497 --> 00:06:12.623
I've changed my mind.

00:06:12.874 --> 00:06:15.751
I'll command you all, just like you wanted!

00:06:16.002 --> 00:06:16.794
We're gonna win!

00:06:17.044 --> 00:06:20.798
And I'm gonna drag the damn arsonist
to the insurance company!

00:06:21.048 --> 00:06:23.175
Master Reigen's all fired up!

00:06:23.426 --> 00:06:25.386
Now that that's settled,
time to think up a strategy.

00:06:25.636 --> 00:06:27.847
Get everyone a copy of the local map.

00:06:28.097 --> 00:06:31.267
The enemy is apparently jamming
all electronic devices.

00:06:31.517 --> 00:06:34.604
Looks like I was being a bit too negative.

00:06:38.441 --> 00:06:42.111
You're pretty strong.
You probably didn't even need my help.

00:06:42.361 --> 00:06:45.656
Ritsu, your latent abilities
far surpass your brother's.

00:06:45.907 --> 00:06:48.868
My abilities? There's no way that's true.

00:06:49.118 --> 00:06:52.038
Life won't be any fun
if you don't tell yourself that.

00:06:52.288 --> 00:06:55.124
The same goes for me.
I'm more powerful than my dad...

00:06:58.419 --> 00:07:01.797
As I figured, you really are
leading the uprising, Sho-kun.

00:07:02.048 --> 00:07:04.091
Talk about a textbook rebellious phase.

00:07:04.342 --> 00:07:07.762
His aura is really peculiar. Who is that?

00:07:08.012 --> 00:07:10.556
One of the Ultimate 5,
the highest echelon of Claw.

00:07:10.806 --> 00:07:12.475
That's Minegishi the plant user.

00:07:12.725 --> 00:07:14.602
Get caught by his plants, and you're finished.

00:07:14.852 --> 00:07:17.271
You get turned into plant food.

00:07:17.521 --> 00:07:19.774
We'd be at a disadvantage if
we fought him in a forest,

00:07:20.024 --> 00:07:22.151
but too bad for him,
this is a concrete jungle.

00:07:22.401 --> 00:07:24.570
We'll take care of him.

00:07:24.820 --> 00:07:27.156
Please go on ahead, leader.

00:07:27.406 --> 00:07:28.658
You guys...

00:07:28.908 --> 00:07:31.035
All right, Ritsu! Let's go!

00:07:32.870 --> 00:07:33.996
I have my doubts.

00:07:35.456 --> 00:07:38.417
Hey, look up in the sky!

00:07:38.668 --> 00:07:39.752
What's going on?

00:07:40.002 --> 00:07:41.796
Are the government's espers attacking?

00:07:42.046 --> 00:07:43.547
Shoot them down!

00:07:48.260 --> 00:07:49.845
None of us are getting in those cars.

00:07:50.096 --> 00:07:53.307
The first step in our plan is to
mess with the enemy formation.

00:07:53.557 --> 00:07:57.937
Try to buy us as much time as possible
before they realize it's a decoy.

00:07:58.187 --> 00:08:02.608
Um, Teru-san...
Is my telekinesis helping at all?

00:08:02.858 --> 00:08:03.693
Yeah.

00:08:03.943 --> 00:08:07.655
It's like when someone uses their pinky
to help you carry some heavy luggage.

00:08:07.905 --> 00:08:10.491
Can you even call that helping?

00:08:15.329 --> 00:08:18.249
Damn it... I really can't do this alone!

00:08:18.499 --> 00:08:20.042
Would you like some help, young man?

00:08:20.292 --> 00:08:21.210
Who are you?

00:08:21.460 --> 00:08:23.462
Oh, you decided to show up, too?

00:08:23.713 --> 00:08:25.548
My name is Takeuchi.

00:08:25.798 --> 00:08:29.093
I am a master of the miraculous
art of super gigong.

00:08:29.343 --> 00:08:31.762
You just need to make some cars fly, correct?

00:08:32.013 --> 00:08:34.181
What's happening on the surface
is merely a diversion.

00:08:34.432 --> 00:08:38.269
We're going to infiltrate their main camp
through the sewers and defeat the boss.

00:08:40.813 --> 00:08:42.898
--This way.
--Once they lose their leader,

00:08:43.149 --> 00:08:45.985
none of them will be a threat individually.

00:08:54.118 --> 00:08:55.661
It's not just an ordinary paper fan?

00:08:55.911 --> 00:08:59.081
It's been turned into a device
that amplifies shock waves.

00:09:02.043 --> 00:09:04.170
Guys, get behind my shield!

00:09:04.420 --> 00:09:08.090
He disassembled and reassembled
the shredded vines and leaves?

00:09:08.340 --> 00:09:10.009
That's an interesting technique.

00:09:10.259 --> 00:09:15.306
I can even make a human-like doll from a
fridge as long as it has the right materials.

00:09:15.556 --> 00:09:16.849
You all right?

00:09:17.099 --> 00:09:17.850
I'm fine.

00:09:18.100 --> 00:09:21.145
The other one's a rare healing type.

00:09:21.395 --> 00:09:24.857
They're perfectly balanced in
attack, defense, and support.

00:09:25.107 --> 00:09:28.152
I guess I should get a little serious.

00:09:31.447 --> 00:09:33.157
Should you really be here?

00:09:33.407 --> 00:09:35.201
What the hell am I supposed to do out there?

00:09:35.451 --> 00:09:37.369
Besides, when Mob wakes up,

00:09:37.620 --> 00:09:41.332
it'll probably help if he has someone here
to explain the situation to him.

00:09:41.582 --> 00:09:44.877
But man, he's really knocked out.

00:09:45.127 --> 00:09:48.380
He wouldn't be out so long
if he was just tired.

00:09:48.631 --> 00:09:50.132
Master Reigen! There's trouble!

00:09:50.382 --> 00:09:52.802
Our security system picked up some intruders!

00:09:53.052 --> 00:09:54.470
Intruders?!

00:09:54.720 --> 00:09:57.765
Claw? How'd they find this place?

00:09:58.015 --> 00:09:59.141
I'll lead you to the rear exit.

00:09:59.391 --> 00:10:01.352
No, it's no good to run off without a plan.

00:10:01.602 --> 00:10:02.728
We have to hide!

00:10:15.324 --> 00:10:17.868
There's no doubt about it. They're in there.

00:10:18.119 --> 00:10:21.330
You guys shaking in your boots in there?

00:10:21.580 --> 00:10:24.041
Get your asses out here!

00:10:24.291 --> 00:10:25.417
What do you want to do, Reigen?

00:10:25.668 --> 00:10:27.962
Want me to possess you and brawl with them?

00:10:28.212 --> 00:10:29.296
I'll open the door.

00:10:29.547 --> 00:10:31.298
Stay on your guard.

00:10:35.845 --> 00:10:38.305
You got me. I give up.

00:10:38.556 --> 00:10:40.182
I'm not an esper.

00:10:40.432 --> 00:10:42.309
You can tell with your tracing powers, right?

00:10:42.560 --> 00:10:47.189
This kid here is an esper, but he
hasn't woken up since last night.

00:10:47.439 --> 00:10:48.983
Let me take him to the hospital.

00:10:49.233 --> 00:10:53.112
This guy's pretty suspicious.
He might be packing a weapon.

00:10:53.362 --> 00:10:54.864
Frisk them.

00:10:56.115 --> 00:10:59.535
I don't have any weapons. I just have
my cellphone and a handkerchief.

00:10:59.785 --> 00:11:02.037
This guy's got something
in his inside pocket.

00:11:02.288 --> 00:11:05.207
Oh, it's just some cologne.
I work in the service industry.

00:11:05.457 --> 00:11:07.501
It's a great scent. See?

00:11:13.841 --> 00:11:17.720
Apparently, it's filled with a curse
that causes extreme drowsiness.

00:11:17.970 --> 00:11:20.598
I confiscated it from four-eyes a while ago.

00:11:20.848 --> 00:11:23.392
To think it'd actually come in handy here.

00:11:24.560 --> 00:11:26.937
I thought you were trash,
but you're not so bad.

00:11:27.188 --> 00:11:30.024
You'll have to deal with me next.

00:11:30.274 --> 00:11:31.483
He's huge!

00:11:31.734 --> 00:11:33.277
Here we go.

00:11:38.240 --> 00:11:41.035
He looked strong,
but thankfully he's also an idiot.

00:11:41.285 --> 00:11:43.871
Seriously, what's with this
ridiculous luck of yours?

00:11:44.121 --> 00:11:46.248
You're definitely going
to die a horrible death.

00:11:50.502 --> 00:11:51.754
"Mob Psycho 100 II"

00:11:53.255 --> 00:11:56.717
"Mob Psycho 100 II"

00:11:57.593 --> 00:12:00.012
What a splendid sight.

00:12:00.262 --> 00:12:04.850
We destroyed all that,
yet I don't feel a bit of remorse.

00:12:05.100 --> 00:12:07.728
Sacrifices must be made in
the name of world domination.

00:12:07.978 --> 00:12:09.438
Is that really true?

00:12:09.688 --> 00:12:12.524
Why the long face, Serizawa?

00:12:12.775 --> 00:12:14.902
Let me give you a word of advice.

00:12:15.152 --> 00:12:17.696
Yes, President! I'd love to hear it!

00:12:17.947 --> 00:12:21.200
The secret behind my undying positivity

00:12:21.450 --> 00:12:25.454
is because I've never once
concerned myself with how others feel.

00:12:25.704 --> 00:12:28.916
I've lived my life up till now
exactly how I wanted.

00:12:29.166 --> 00:12:32.962
Everything will always work out
as long as I can count on myself.

00:12:33.212 --> 00:12:37.675
I doubt my spirit will break
even if I ever lose all of you.

00:12:37.925 --> 00:12:41.470
I've decided to take over the world,
so I'll do so, even if it's by myself.

00:12:41.720 --> 00:12:43.264
Since I have the audacity to say that,

00:12:43.514 --> 00:12:46.433
the world is basically already in my hands.

00:12:46.684 --> 00:12:51.730
Serizawa, I think very highly
of your potential.

00:12:51.981 --> 00:12:54.817
You held back on Joseph, didn't you?

00:12:55.067 --> 00:12:58.028
You need to obtain a unimpassioned,
audacious positivity.

00:12:58.279 --> 00:13:00.781
Then you can be just like me.

00:13:01.031 --> 00:13:04.285
I see! If I do my best,
I can be a corporate executive, too?

00:13:04.535 --> 00:13:07.621
Pretty sure his misunderstanding
has gotten even worse...

00:13:07.871 --> 00:13:10.416
First off, this isn't a company.

00:13:13.127 --> 00:13:15.212
What now? They found out where we were!

00:13:15.462 --> 00:13:17.548
First, we'll grab a taxi...

00:13:19.466 --> 00:13:20.801
Hey!

00:13:21.051 --> 00:13:23.012
What the hell? Weren't you sleeping?

00:13:23.262 --> 00:13:26.974
Looks like I've awakened
thanks to you, dumb-ass!

00:13:27.224 --> 00:13:30.394
Right. Got it...
I seriously give up this time.

00:13:30.644 --> 00:13:31.437
If anything, we're--

00:13:31.687 --> 00:13:33.731
You idiot! Run, Reigen!

00:13:37.651 --> 00:13:39.153
Mob!

00:13:39.403 --> 00:13:41.030
Psycho Steroid!

00:13:41.280 --> 00:13:45.492
I frequently send psychic signals to
my muscles and continuously adjust--

00:13:45.743 --> 00:13:48.037
Yeah, sure. Goodnight.

00:13:52.750 --> 00:13:53.876
Now he's lost his cool.

00:13:54.126 --> 00:13:56.211
He's powered up even more!

00:13:56.462 --> 00:13:58.922
I'm getting really sick of this,
but I'll lure him out!

00:13:59.173 --> 00:14:02.134
He's not coming? Mob, wake up!

00:14:15.981 --> 00:14:18.400
I panicked for a second,
but this guy's not an evil spirit.

00:14:18.650 --> 00:14:19.568
He's human!

00:14:19.818 --> 00:14:21.278
That means I can break him!

00:14:23.781 --> 00:14:26.742
Okay, I retract that last statement.
This guy's not human.

00:14:26.992 --> 00:14:29.995
Shit! This isn't good! Catch him, Reigen!

00:14:30.245 --> 00:14:33.207
You got it! I once joined
the boys' volleyball team on a trial basis!

00:14:33.457 --> 00:14:34.583
Just take it easy on me!

00:14:37.961 --> 00:14:38.754
Dimple!

00:14:39.004 --> 00:14:41.673
I-Is Mob's body okay?

00:14:41.924 --> 00:14:44.385
That was close... I think he's okay.

00:14:44.635 --> 00:14:46.845
It's all thanks to his shoe falling off.

00:14:47.096 --> 00:14:49.139
But now I'm certain...

00:14:49.390 --> 00:14:51.642
I definitely can't win this fight!

00:14:51.892 --> 00:14:54.269
Can't let that giant lug catch me!

00:15:00.984 --> 00:15:03.112
Uh... Are they going to be okay?

00:15:05.197 --> 00:15:08.617
The terrorist organization that has
taken over part of Seasoning City

00:15:08.867 --> 00:15:10.953
continues to wreak havoc across the city.

00:15:11.203 --> 00:15:14.623
Citizens are being ordered to stay inside.

00:15:14.873 --> 00:15:16.208
You guys won't believe this!

00:15:17.292 --> 00:15:18.377
Look!

00:15:18.377 --> 00:15:18.502
"Super Ultra Rare"
Look!

00:15:18.502 --> 00:15:18.752
"Super Ultra Rare"

00:15:18.752 --> 00:15:20.337
"Super Ultra Rare"
I rolled a super ultra rare!

00:15:20.337 --> 00:15:20.504
"Super Ultra Rare"

00:15:20.587 --> 00:15:22.005
--For real?!
--Wow!

00:15:22.256 --> 00:15:24.007
Inukawa, did you spend more mon--

00:15:26.009 --> 00:15:29.555
Fight on! Fight on! Fight on!

00:15:30.305 --> 00:15:33.058
IIMPDII
You can't go past here, even on foot.

00:15:33.058 --> 00:15:33.308
IIMPDII

00:15:33.308 --> 00:15:34.268
IIMPDII
Haven't you seen the news?

00:15:34.268 --> 00:15:34.435
IIMPDII

00:15:34.518 --> 00:15:36.103
What should we do, Captain?

00:15:36.353 --> 00:15:37.813
Guess we'll just have to change our course.

00:15:38.063 --> 00:15:40.858
The same scenery all the time
gets boring anyway.

00:15:41.108 --> 00:15:44.653
--Body improvement!
--Fight on! Fight--

00:15:45.529 --> 00:15:47.573
I knew something was off.

00:15:47.823 --> 00:15:49.908
I guess the cars in the sky
were a decoy after all.

00:15:50.159 --> 00:15:53.203
Which means there's probably another group.

00:15:53.454 --> 00:15:55.622
Let's get some information out of them.

00:15:55.873 --> 00:15:57.666
So many Scars...

00:15:57.916 --> 00:15:59.376
But we have to do this.

00:15:59.626 --> 00:16:02.129
Hey, you're Terada.

00:16:02.379 --> 00:16:05.048
You really did betray us, huh?

00:16:05.299 --> 00:16:07.926
You're Ishihara, a Scar from the 4th Division.

00:16:08.177 --> 00:16:10.429
What a rude accusation!

00:16:10.679 --> 00:16:13.974
I was acting as a spy
and gathering information.

00:16:14.224 --> 00:16:16.393
I can give you the information
you need on the enemy.

00:16:16.643 --> 00:16:20.063
In return, let me join HQ's operation.

00:16:20.314 --> 00:16:21.231
Terada-san!

00:16:21.482 --> 00:16:22.649
How could you?

00:16:22.900 --> 00:16:24.568
This is a nightmare!

00:16:28.071 --> 00:16:31.492
Did you actually think you had a chance
because there were three of you?

00:16:31.742 --> 00:16:36.121
Never forget that the Ultimate 5 and
mere mortals are like night and day.

00:16:38.499 --> 00:16:42.294
We're almost there.
If we keep going straight...

00:16:42.544 --> 00:16:43.962
Wait, stop!

00:16:45.047 --> 00:16:47.549
Something doesn't feel right up ahead...

00:16:47.799 --> 00:16:48.842
There's something there.

00:16:49.092 --> 00:16:50.886
--What is it?
--Here it comes!

00:16:55.557 --> 00:16:58.060
Hello, Scars.

00:16:58.310 --> 00:17:03.023
I thought you were sewer rats since
you were scuttling around down here.

00:17:04.233 --> 00:17:05.943
How unsightly.

00:17:06.193 --> 00:17:08.237
Let's end this here.

00:17:11.490 --> 00:17:12.824
There's a crowd.

00:17:13.075 --> 00:17:16.495
There's gonna be even more casualties,
but I'll just have to blend in and lose him.

00:17:17.538 --> 00:17:19.206
Whoa, that's amazing.

00:17:19.456 --> 00:17:20.874
Who is that guy? A pro wrestler?

00:17:21.124 --> 00:17:23.460
--Hey, don't push!
--He's sorta scary.

00:17:23.710 --> 00:17:26.922
No way... That can't be...

00:17:27.172 --> 00:17:28.882
It's Tsubomi-chan!

00:17:29.925 --> 00:17:31.843
If something were to happen to Tsubomi-chan,

00:17:32.094 --> 00:17:34.429
Shigeo would erase me!

00:17:34.680 --> 00:17:36.098
I have to stop him!

00:17:38.767 --> 00:17:40.852
Full-power barrier!

00:17:45.107 --> 00:17:46.483
Huh?

00:17:46.733 --> 00:17:49.570
He hit so hard that
my possession came undone?

00:17:49.820 --> 00:17:52.072
What the hell?
A home run out of the park?!

00:17:52.322 --> 00:17:54.741
Wake up, Shigeo! Wake up!

00:18:07.296 --> 00:18:09.798
Why did Kageyama come falling from the sky?

00:18:10.048 --> 00:18:13.093
Maybe someone was trying a long throw.

00:18:13.343 --> 00:18:14.928
I wonder who he is.

00:18:15.178 --> 00:18:17.097
Those are some impressive muscles.

00:18:17.347 --> 00:18:20.851
Were you the one who threw Kageyama?

00:18:21.101 --> 00:18:22.978
Kageyama is a member of our club.

00:18:23.228 --> 00:18:26.064
Whoever you are, I request
that you take your leave.

00:18:31.820 --> 00:18:32.696
Captain!

00:18:32.946 --> 00:18:35.866
You bastard! Who the hell
do you think you are?!

00:18:36.116 --> 00:18:38.535
I'll show you how much stronger I've gotten!

00:18:38.785 --> 00:18:40.537
Demon Rush!

00:18:40.787 --> 00:18:42.748
Now it's our turn!

00:18:44.207 --> 00:18:45.751
Fight!

00:18:46.001 --> 00:18:47.252
Onigawara!!

00:18:51.590 --> 00:18:54.134
--No way!
--With just one arm?!

00:19:21.662 --> 00:19:24.289
I don't know what you have against him,

00:19:24.539 --> 00:19:28.752
but he doesn't deserve to
have you step on his head!

00:19:29.002 --> 00:19:31.296
Say, Kageyama...

00:19:34.257 --> 00:19:37.219
That's right. You've worked so hard.

00:19:37.469 --> 00:19:40.097
No matter how many times
you've passed out from anemia...

00:19:40.347 --> 00:19:42.974
No matter how many times you've stumbled...

00:19:43.225 --> 00:19:45.310
You've always been running right behind us.

00:19:45.560 --> 00:19:47.771
Just seeing you like that...

00:19:48.021 --> 00:19:53.110
...gives us courage!

00:19:53.360 --> 00:19:57.364
That's not going to break
because of something like this!

00:20:02.494 --> 00:20:07.958
I won't let you have Kageyama!

00:20:17.134 --> 00:20:20.011
That's Shigeo's senior for you.

00:20:20.262 --> 00:20:22.139
This guy's ripped!

00:20:22.389 --> 00:20:24.599
Here we go! Unleashed!

00:20:25.392 --> 00:20:27.102
"Muscle Usage 100%"

00:20:41.616 --> 00:20:43.326
What the hell are you so surprised about?

00:20:43.577 --> 00:20:46.037
Muscles built using psychic powers
don't stand a chance

00:20:46.288 --> 00:20:50.250
against muscles built by
training diligently every day.

00:20:50.500 --> 00:20:52.961
This guy is way out of your league!

00:20:53.211 --> 00:20:55.255
Shigeo was right.

00:21:09.936 --> 00:21:11.855
Captain!

00:21:12.105 --> 00:21:14.191
You're so awesome, Captain!

00:21:14.441 --> 00:21:17.486
Is that what they call an adrenaline rush?!

00:21:17.736 --> 00:21:19.905
All that training paid off!

00:21:20.155 --> 00:21:22.491
I-I did that?

00:21:22.741 --> 00:21:25.076
We need to celebrate your growth!

00:21:25.327 --> 00:21:27.871
Heave-ho! Heave-ho!

00:21:28.121 --> 00:21:30.332
Heave-ho! Heave-ho!

00:21:30.582 --> 00:21:32.709
Shit! That guy's getting up again!

00:21:32.959 --> 00:21:33.752
You can't be serious!

00:21:34.002 --> 00:21:35.295
What should we do, Captain?!

00:21:35.545 --> 00:21:38.590
Actually... I haven't been able
to raise my arms for a while...

00:21:38.840 --> 00:21:41.009
I probably won't be able to do that again.

00:21:42.427 --> 00:21:43.595
Here he comes!

00:21:48.975 --> 00:21:51.228
Kageyama!

00:21:51.478 --> 00:21:53.814
Everyone from the club?

00:21:54.064 --> 00:21:56.441
Oh, whoops.

00:21:56.691 --> 00:21:58.902
I guess I was sleeping.

00:22:01.696 --> 00:22:04.825
Make sure you don't fall asleep
outdoors again, Kageyama.

00:22:05.075 --> 00:22:06.701
Sorry about that.

00:22:09.287 --> 00:22:12.123
Dimple, what's going on right now?

00:22:16.586 --> 00:22:18.964
We're finally here.

00:22:19.214 --> 00:22:22.300
Just you wait, Dad!

00:22:36.982 --> 00:22:42.279
I spilled a seed and lost sight of it

00:22:45.907 --> 00:22:50.787
I'll find it using the color it's dyed in
and watch it grow

00:22:53.498 --> 00:22:59.170
It immediately returned
to the palm of my hand

00:22:59.421 --> 00:23:08.513
But it's still too light and too frail
to reach for the skies

00:23:10.056 --> 00:23:14.352
The world coldly drains away all the heat

00:23:14.603 --> 00:23:18.940
The bright sunshine just isn't enough

00:23:19.190 --> 00:23:23.445
The memories are closing off what lies ahead

00:23:23.695 --> 00:23:28.867
Shake off their warmth
and set off into the distance

00:23:30.118 --> 00:23:35.373
If I let it wither, it'd be over just like that

00:23:35.624 --> 00:23:40.545
But my hope just doesn't fade away

00:23:55.977 --> 00:23:58.313
After waking up,
Mob heads for Seasoning Cultural Tower.

00:23:58.563 --> 00:24:00.815
But he finds himself up against
Minegishi from the Ultimate 5!

00:24:01.066 --> 00:24:03.318
Leave the strongest of
the Ultimate 5, Shimazaki, to me!

00:24:03.568 --> 00:24:05.570
Next time on Mob Psycho 100 Il Episode 11:

00:24:05.820 --> 00:24:07.197
"Guidance
- Psychic Sensor~."

00:24:07.197 --> 00:24:07.322
"Guidance - Psychic Sensor~"
"Guidance - Psychic Sensor~."

00:24:07.322 --> 00:24:07.572
"Guidance
- Psychic Sensor~"

00:24:07.572 --> 00:24:09.991
"Guidance - Psychic Sensor~" Option B, the serious course,
involves buying the Blu-rays and the manga volumes.

00:24:09.991 --> 00:24:10.158
"Guidance
